   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Every screen and component in the app, drawn to the measurements and colours\nthat are actually in the CSS. Dark panels are the real UI; the orange monospace\nnotes are exact values; the green notes say what a thing does or when it changes.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Every screen and component in the app, drawn to the measurements and colours\nthat are actually in the CSS. Dark panels are the real UI; the orange monospace\nnotes are exact values; the green notes say what a thing does or when it changes.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
