   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Two kinds of row, and the difference\nis the whole story:\n\n  breach \u2014 it happened, red/blue\n  warn   \u2014 it was called out first\n\nA warning followed by a breach inside\n4s stops counting as prevented. That\nhonesty is the point; do not hide it.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Two kinds of row, and the difference\nis the whole story:\n\n  breach \u2014 it happened, red/blue\n  warn   \u2014 it was called out first\n\nA warning followed by a breach inside\n4s stops counting as prevented. That\nhonesty is the point; do not hide it.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
