   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Prediction\n  the arrow is conceptual \u2014 not drawn today.\n  Worth designing: it is the one thing on screen\n  that shows this system is preventive, and right\n  now a judge has to be told rather than shown.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Prediction\n  the arrow is conceptual \u2014 not drawn today.\n  Worth designing: it is the one thing on screen\n  that shows this system is preventive, and right\n  now a judge has to be told rather than shown.",
