   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "The video is object-fit: cover but the overlay canvas maps 0\u20131 across the full\nstage. When the camera aspect differs from the stage, boxes sit slightly off\nthe person and a drawn zone is not quite where the detector thinks it is.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The video is object-fit: cover but the overlay canvas maps 0\u20131 across the full\nstage. When the camera aspect differs from the stage, boxes sit slightly off\nthe person and a drawn zone is not quite where the detector thinks it is.",
